WEBVTT

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:04.720
I'm sorry I couldn't just leave you be.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:07.500
<b>This program is a work of fiction. The characters, organizations, locations, cases, etc. being portrayed are unrelated to actual events.</b>

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.500
I just couldn't walk away...

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:12.210
after I'd found you again.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.660
Let's see...

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.790
Tell me.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:21.880
What's your name?

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:29.570
Who are you, and why do you 
call yourself Ryang-Ha Song?

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.410
Don't move.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:26.040
Do as I say, and I won't hurt you.

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.520
Follow my instructions.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.910
I don't know how to tell you this...

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:37.520
but I took out all the bullets.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.430
Please don't do that.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:46.480
Really.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.610
I don't like fighting and stuff.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:56.400
So, is there something you wanted from me?

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.590
And then, by the time the police 
arrived, everyone was gone...

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:09.100
There was nothing left to even see.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.240
Are you listening?

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:14.870
Where did you come from, anyway?

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:16.750
Do you have family? Friends?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.710
You're obviously going through something.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:24.680
Do you have a place to go home to?

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.930
What's your deal?

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.250
Why did you help me?

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.520
Why take me in like this?

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:36.630
I didn't expect this, either.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:41.780
I can't let you stay here forever.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.700
Let's take care of your injuries...

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:54.440
I haven't even asked his name yet.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.670
Oh, well.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:04.770
I swear, we would've won that 
night game if you'd shown up.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:06.640
Okay, okay, I'm sorry.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.180
You'd better be there for the next one.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.270
Okay.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.280
Look at where he's fallen asleep this time.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.060
Sorry...

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.850
<i>It's been five days.</i>

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:01.940
<i>Mr. Donny's client should 
be calling tomorrow.</i>

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:05.850
<i>I can't keep him here any longer.</i>

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:07.660
Thanks for having me.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.870
I'll be gone by morning.

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:15.000
Do you have somewhere to go?

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:20.790
I'll take you to the station tomorrow.

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:22.880
If you don't mind, that is.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.380
Okay.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.940
Shit! After I've come this far...

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:47.320
Seriously, I only took my eyes off it 
for a second to go to the bathroom!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.170
It's a white suitcase.

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.210
With a red sticker on it.

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:53.850
Well, I'll need you to file a report and...

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:56.810
I'm begging you because I can't do that!

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:58.830
Please, come on! Help me find it!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.030
I'm back.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:00.710
Here.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:02.730
This'll get you to the city.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.340
Just hop off wherever you want.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.090
That's all I can do.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.350
Sorry I couldn't help you.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.310
Why are you apologizing?

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:20.360
Yeah, that's fair, I guess... I just...

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:26.960
"I'll help you."

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.490
That's what he said.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.240
He was a well-dressed man.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:37.750
I followed him like the idiot I was, 
and I got the shit beat out of me.

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:44.750
They dislocated both my shoulders, shoved 
me in a container, and sent me to this town.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:50.380
People like that are all I've 
had contact with until now.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:56.050
So someone like you is strange to me.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.050
The train's here.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.100
Yeah.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.980
Oh, right.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.150
What's your name?

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.710
You haven't told me your name yet.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.580
I'm Ryang-Ha Song.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:13.780
Of all the times...

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.990
Hey... Wait!

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.270
This is no way to say goodbye!

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:22.790
Hello?

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:24.830
Liszt Noble here.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.910
Are you the guide?

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:31.300
<i>Yes. I'll be right there.</i>

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.050
Where are you now?

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.450
Mr. Noble?

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.340
Is something wrong?

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.690
Please...

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.770
Hurry... and find...

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.780
<i>Please stay calm, Mr. Noble.</i>

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:53.030
<i>I'll be right there.</i>

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:57.990
Mr. Noble?

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.570
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:00.890
<i>Mr. Noble?</i>

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.250
Mr. Noble?! Answer me!

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:06.500
Stop trying.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.380
The shooter is on the other end.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:14.920
<i>All right, come back, Seung-Woo.</i>

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.230
What about the accomplice?

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.390
<i>That's not our business.</i>

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.080
<i>Leave him.</i>

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.270
Understood.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:28.860
Hey, wait up!

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.530
Where are you going, Ryang-Ha?!

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.140
<i>Are you the guide?</i>

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.510
<i>There's an accessway between 
the station and the port.</i>

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.720
<i>Past the west exit, 
there are some old coin lockers.</i>

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.540
<i>The lock on the one by the wall is broken.</i>

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:43.530
<i>Check inside there.</i>

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:48.670
A suitcase?

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.920
What the hell is this?

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.170
Pirated DVDs?

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.050
Not exactly the treasure I was expecting.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.070
<i>Please...</i>

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.310
<i>Hurry...</i>

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:08.050
<i>Please... find her.</i>

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.710
H-Hang on a second.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.420
This is a crime.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.720
What are you going to do with that luggage?

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.510
Do you want to be questioned or something?

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.970
I don't care about your circumstances.

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:40.840
Get in or don't. It's up to you.

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:43.810
I missed the train. That's all.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.310
Chateau!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.440
There's my girl!

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:53.700
Daddy!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.820
Um...

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.340
That figures.

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.620
Pee...

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:14.590
I have to pee.

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:37.370
You should have just let her pee
 on the side of the road.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.650
No way. She's a girl.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.330
They were watching. Get us out of here quick.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:45.730
Yeah, yeah. I know.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.630
You'll be all right now.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.990
Okay? Please don't cry.

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:03.080
Her name.

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:06.140
Why don't you ask her name?

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:09.390
Can you tell me your name?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.540
Mine's Ryang-Ha.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.270
Ryang-Ha Song.

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:23.120
Please... Could you tell me your name?

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.660
Chateau Noble.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.550
Chateau, huh?

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.350
Yes...

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.420
Daddy, where are you?

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:44.960
I don't want to play hide-and-seek anymore.

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:49.430
Please come find me soon, Daddy...

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.510
<i>Please...</i>

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:54.810
<i>Hurry...</i>

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.320
<i>Please... find her.</i>

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:04.420
<i>Noble was desperate to save her.</i>

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:08.370
<i>He entrusted her to me.</i>

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:16.590
Chateau, I don't know if you'll 
believe me, but I'm on your side.

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:20.410
I'm going to take you somewhere safe.

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:22.470
I promise.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.990
Guess she got tired of crying.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:31.980
Good.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:35.770
I would have lost it if she'd kept it up.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.160
Thanks for helping me out.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:45.560
I mean today, too, 
but also the day we first met.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.950
You saved me when I was being attacked.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:56.040
I keep missing the chance to ask your name.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.390
Huh?

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:01.950
Like, when you told me to 
ask her name just now...

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.670
You should have said something.

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:06.550
At least introduce yourself.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.820
I'm an outsider.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.310
That would make things complicated.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:11.950
There's no point.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:16.560
Anyway, what do you plan to do now, Ryang-Ha?

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.190
What do you mean?

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:24.440
Do you understand what you're 
being made to do right now?

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:29.570
What do you mean?

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:30.970
What are you trying to say?

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.080
Nothing.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.040
It's just a warning.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.380
I wish you well, Ryang-Ha Song.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:02.320
It doesn't look like anyone 
will be here for a while.

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.670
<i>I hope she doesn't have a cold or anything.</i>

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:14.080
<i>Or a fever.</i>

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.850
Who...?

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:20.920
You're that man from earlier...

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.910
Th-That's right.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.170
I'm Ryang-Ha.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.880
Don't worry. It's all right.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.660
<i>I thought she'd start crying again.</i>

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.060
What are you doing?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:42.940
Huh?

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:52.020
Let's impose just for tonight.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:58.290
After all your complaining about 
the car, this isn't criminal?

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:04.640
I-I mean, it'll raise suspicion if 
the three of us try to book a hotel.

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:07.150
I want to rest while we can.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:09.930
Barosela's still pretty far off.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.380
Barosela?

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.610
I see.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.270
I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.640
I don't intend to pry.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.270
I'll get out of the car in some town
 along the way tomorrow.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:26.170
Will that do?

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.680
<i>I messed up.</i>

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:34.450
<i>I don't know the first thing about this guy.</i>

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:41.160
<i>There's no guarantee that he won't use the 
information he gains while he's with me.</i>

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.460
<i>Does he know too much?</i>

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.540
<i>What if he's with the enemy?</i>

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:50.300
Or should I shut you up here?

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:55.970
N-No, that's not what I meant!

00:15:58.030 --> 00:16:00.480
This is my final warning.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:05.620
Ryang-Ha, your half-assed determination 
is going to be the end of you.

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:11.780
Please stop saying such weird things.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.280
It makes me scared of you.

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.290
I see. Sorry about that.

00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:28.550
Wait. Where are you going?

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:32.430
It doesn't look like I have 
until tomorrow, does it?

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:34.700
I'll get off here.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.530
<i>No...</i>

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.060
<i>I have to stop him!</i>

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.810
Don't you dare die, Ryang-Ha.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:09.590
I'm the worst.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.840
I was the one who got him 
involved in the first place.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.070
Damn it!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.250
I don't need this shit!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.600
Daddy?

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:35.480
Mister?

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:38.240
Where are you?

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.080
He's gone.

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:53.090
<i>At least tell me your name.</i>

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.210
<i>Asshole.</i>

00:17:56.830 --> 00:18:00.570
<i>Nothing good comes of getting 
involved in other people's business.</i>

00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:11.820
Heya.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.350
Been a while.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:15.070
Where's your buddy?

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:21.320
Is no one there?

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.920
<i>He's been following me.</i>

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.320
<i>Since when?</i>

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.600
<i>The guys from the service area.</i>

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:03.300
Don't you two lay a hand on him.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.980
I'm going to avenge Louis.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.680
This one's mine.

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:11.770
He's running away.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:12.860
After him!

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.630
Chateau?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.790
I found him! Over here!

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:01.550
Tch... Bastard. Wasting our time...

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.000
What now, Boris?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.050
I say we deal with him right he—

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:11.080
I told you not to touch him.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.060
You're gonna ruin the fun.

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:27.830
Chateau?

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.330
You're there, aren't you?

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:39.000
<i>She was all alone when she woke up.</i>

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:41.710
<i>She must have been terrified.</i>

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.490
It's okay.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:53.580
There aren't any bad guys here.

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:54.500
Come out.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:02.720
Please.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:03.990
I want you to believe me.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.630
I'm on your side.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:20.720
I'm sorry.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.680
I'm sorry.

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.170
I'm sorry.

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:26.270
I'm sorry.

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:27.530
I'm sorry.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.730
I'm sorry.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.460
I'm sorry.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.940
I'm sorry.

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:34.740
I'm sorry.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:39.970
I'm sorry.

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.750
I'm sorry.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:43.980
I'm sorry.

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:45.740
I'm sorry.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:47.810
I'm sorry.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.540
I'm sorry.

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:51.540
I'm sorry.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.350
I'm sorry.

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:55.030
I'm sorry.

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:40.020
Next episode: "My Name."
